    <div class="cbox-14-0 p_item"><div class="e_container-15 s_layout">
    <div class="cbox-15-0 p_item"><p class="e_text-18 s_title">
  <svg t="1704416552457" class="icon" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" p-id="4197" width="200" height="200"><path d="M302.348186 44.311245l127.714918 0 0 127.710618-127.714918 0 0-127.710618ZM430.06208 172.021862l127.721984 0 0 127.707546-127.721984 0 0-127.707546ZM557.784064 299.729408l127.711846 0 0 127.709594-127.711846 0 0-127.709594ZM685.49591 427.43808l127.714918 0 0 127.716762-127.714918 0 0-127.716762ZM557.784064 555.154842l127.711846 0 0 127.701402-127.711846 0 0-127.701402ZM430.06208 682.856346l127.721984 0 0 127.717786-127.721984 0 0-127.717786ZM302.348186 818.553856 302.348186 938.280755 302.348186 946.261504 430.06208 946.261504 430.06208 938.280755 430.06208 818.553856 430.06208 810.574131 302.348186 810.574131Z" p-id="4198"></path></svg>  产品详情
</p><hr class="e_line-86 s_line" /><div class="e_container-27 s_layout">
    <div class="cbox-27-0 p_item"><div class="e_richText-65 s_title clearfix p_articles">
    <p><span style="line-height:2;">充油接线盒：型号：STJA-A（缆径mm）-B（光缆芯数），工作深度：6000米</span></p>

<p><span style="line-height:2;"><strong>产品优势</strong></span></p>

<p><span style="line-height:2;"><strong>&middot;&nbsp;</strong>用于实现高压电缆/光电缆水下转接<br />
<strong>&middot;&nbsp;</strong>配备油压补偿器保持盒内与外界压力平衡<br />
<strong>&middot;&nbsp;</strong>根据不同规格缆线定制相应产品</span></p>

<p><br />
<span style="line-height:2;">补偿器：补偿体积及外形尺寸可根据客户需求可定制</span></p>

<p><strong><span style="line-height:2;">技术参数：</span></strong></p>

<p><span style="line-height:2;">工作深度：3000米（非金属）；</span></p>

<p><span style="line-height:2;">材料参数：主壳体：Acetal </span></p>

<p><span style="line-height:2;">弹簧：316L ；</span></p>

<p><span style="line-height:2;">使用温度：-40℃～70℃；</span></p>

<p><span style="line-height:2;">满载内压：0.04MPa；</span></p>

<p><span style="line-height:2;">补偿体积：0.57L；</span></p>

<p><span style="line-height:2;">外形尺寸：&phi;115x260；</span></p>

</div></div>
</div><div class="e_container-81 s_layout">
    <div class="cbox-81-0 p_item"><hr class="e_line-85 s_line" /></div>
